  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Operation of Al-Ja&#x2019;dah Health Center in Hayran District, Hajjah Governorate</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Saving life, maintaining its continuity, limiting the spread of diseases and epidemics, securing basic health and nutritional services, reproductive health, and supporting the health sector for some of the liberated districts in Hajjah Governorate, and relocating them.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The full readiness of the health center to start providing integrated health and nutritional care services to 88,470 beneficiaries in integrated health care services, child and women health, therapeutic nutrition services, immunization services, reproductive health services, and treatment of people with epidemics.</narrative>
  </description>
